{"@type":"Question","name":"What is BotBento: Agent Box?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A compact workflow kit for people who want useful AI help without building software: 20 AI mini-agent workflow cards, a prompt library, an agent roles library, a run tracker, a Notion-compatible workflow database and safe-use notes. Each card gives the AI a job, inputs, rules, an output format, a review step and a next action."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need code, APIs or automation tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The kit runs inside the AI chat assistant you already use. You paste a role, paste a card, fill in your business context, and review the output like an operator. No accounts, servers or software to install."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Which AI does it work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Any capable AI chat assistant. The cards are written model-agnostic — they define the job, not the vendor. If your assistant can follow structured instructions, the cards work."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"What exactly do I get after paying?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Instant digital access — nothing ships. You get the quick-start guide, all 20 workflow cards, the prompt and roles libraries, five example walkthroughs, the run tracker, the Notion-compatible database template and the safe-use notes, as designed PDFs plus editable Markdown. All v1.x updates included."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"How is this different from the AI Agent Starter Box?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Starter Box (Kit Nº 01) installs a real, always-on agent on your machine and wires it to Telegram or Slack. The Agent Box (Kit Nº 02) needs no install at all — it turns the chat assistant you already have into a set of repeatable mini-agents. They stack well: many people start here and graduate to the Starter Box."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Will this make me money?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We don't promise income — anyone who does is selling you something else. The kit helps you draft and organize repeatable work faster, with a review step so you stay the operator. What you do with the saved hours is up to you."}},
